  "description": {
   "en": "\"Ultraman Super Fighter Gekiden\", which was once very popular in Comic Bonbon (published by Kodansha), is coming back as a complete edition!! There is a wealth of material to read, such as valuable first-time public materials and introductions to episodes and characters that could not be seen in the manga, but only for product development!! Finally decided. Ultraman, who once lost to his destined enemy Zetton and went out to train as a warrior...!? (C) Tsuburaya Productions"
